OL,3,GNEWSABlack smoke rises from Ipswich
OL,4,Agarage fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a blaze
OL,7,Fat a commercial garage unit involving
OL,8,Fmultiple vehicles as thick, black smoke
OL,9,Fcould be seen from across Ipswich.
OL,11,FCrews were sent to Portmans Walk near
OL,12,Fthe football stadium, just before 11:30
OL,13,FGMT.
OL,15,FA Suffolk Fire Service spokesperson
OL,16,Fsaid crews wearing breathing apparatus
OL,17,Fwere tackling the blaze, which measures
OL,18,Fabout 20m by 5m (65ft by 16ft) and is
OL,19,Fthe other side of the road from the
OL,20,Fhousehold waste recycling centre and
OL,21,Fbeyond the Dunwell Motor Group plot.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
